{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05672","headline":"和崔司马登称心山寺 · 孙逖","name":"和崔司马登称心山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡府乘休日，王城访道初。\n觉花迎步履，香草藉行车。\n倚阁观无际，寻山坐太虚。\n岩空迷禹迹，海静望秦余。\n翡翠巢珠网，鵾鸡间绮疏。\n地灵资净土，水若护真如。\n宝树谁攀折，禅云自卷舒。\n晴分五湖势，烟合九夷居。\n生灭纷无象，窥临已得鱼。\n尝闻宝刀赠，今日奉琼琚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}